tep2 TASK-B: verified full post-compaction installed-Skill reads: \" + '; '.join(checks) + '; resumed from qa/progress.md, qa/task-skill.md and durable Host state; qa-prior-reclaim-1 remains pending Host resolution.\\n'\nwith Path('qa/progress.md').open('a') as stream:\n    stream.write(line)\nprint(line, end='')\nPY", "toolCallId": "exec-b72dac68-9c89-4a71-9d00-ead31c8040c6"}}
